Example 8. Compute _f_m(_x_) to 5D for \(x\) = 5 and \(m\) = 0(1)6. We have, retaining two additional decimals

\[\begin{array}{c}K_{0} = .00369 11 \quad K_{1} = .00404 46\\ f_{0} = 1.56738 74 \quad f_{1} = .19595 54\end{array}\]

